OL,3,GNEWSAFive takeaways from Burnham's
OL,4,ACommons debut as PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has taken questions from
OL,7,FMPs in the House of Commons for the
OL,8,Ffirst time since taking over as prime
OL,9,Fminister.
OL,11,FThe statement on his future plans for
OL,12,Fpower comes six weeks after he took
OL,13,Fover from Sir Keir Starmer in July,
OL,14,Fjust before Parliament's summer recess.
OL,16,FHere are the main points from what he
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
