OL,3,GNEWSAFive takeaways from Burnham's
OL,4,ACommons debut as PM
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham told MPs his time as mayor of
OL,7,FGreater Manchester had given him a
OL,8,F"clear theory of growth" that further
OL,9,Fdevolution of power away from
OL,10,FWestminster would help boost the UK's
OL,11,Feconomic prospects.
